	('e0518d71-c843-463b-90a0-9b40e602f6d8', 'f2308fb9-0d05-49a8-b973-5d0d86d41d62', 1, 'RISK_PROFILE_V1', 'INITIAL_IMPORT', 'CYBER_SECURITY', 'MANAGE_CONTINUITY', 'DEPLOY', 'APPROVAL_REQUIRED', 'Backup implementation', 'Digital solutions must have backup implemented (scheduled, executed and monitored) to meet business needs.', 'DFC-QU-SOP-0086073-Backup and Restore - Infrastructure: https://api-eu.sanofi.com:8443/smartlink/api/qualipso/477883', 'Backup requirements describing all the components to be backed up with the required SLA documented and implemented with effective monitoring in place.', 'When attesting this control, consider the following:

